<title>USA: BRE Q2 FFO rise confirms analysts' estimates.</title>
<headline>BRE Q2 FFO rise confirms analysts' estimates.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>BRE Properties Inc Wednesday reported a 12.2-percent rise in funds from operations in the second quarter, confirming analysts' projections.</p>
<p>The real estate investment trust posted $15.8 million in funds from operations in the second quarter, or $0.46 a share, compared with $13.4 million, or $0.41 a share, the year before.</p>
<p>An April 10 First Call consensus estimate of 8 brokers also put the trust's funds from operations at $0.46 a share.</p>
</text>
